# DMSO 4-molecule cluster
# Geometry: DMSO molecules extracted from the final optimized
# Apixaban + 4 DMSO + SMD(DMSO) structure.
#
# Apixaban has been removed. The relative positions/orientations of the
# four optimized DMSO molecules are retained as the starting cluster.
#
# SMD(DMSO) is included so the four-molecule cluster is optimized and
# frequency-analyzed in the same continuum-solvent environment as the
# Apixaban + 4 DMSO calculation.
# It is intended to probe DMSO-DMSO interactions under DMSO solvation.

! r2SCAN-3c TightSCF Opt Freq KeepDens SMD(DMSO)

%pal
  nprocs 4
end

%maxcore 2000

